{
  "id": "A",
  "name": "被叫去玩",
  "preset": "icl-mc-lab",
  "description": "叫她去 MC：期望 mcb_servers/mcb_lan → mcb_join → mcb_status/mcb_look；说清楚自己在哪、要干什么，不把“连接成功”说成“已经在挖矿”。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "prompt",
      "id": "call-to-play",
      "text": "去 MC 里玩会儿吧，去 {{server}} 服，用名字 {{username}}（别用 Hahn123_，那是用户在玩的号）。你自己看看怎么过去。",
      "timeoutSec": 420
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "found-server",
      "toolAny": [
        "mcb_servers",
        "mcb_lan"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "really-joined",
      "toolAll": [
        "mcb_join"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "join-ok",
      "toolResultContains": {
        "names": [
          "mcb_join"
        ],
        "any": [
          "已连接"
        ]
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "checked-state-after-join",
      "toolAny": [
        "mcb_status",
        "mcb_look",
        "mcb_inventory"
      ],
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "body-alive",
      "bodyAlive": true,
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "op": "assert",
      "id": "no-tool-error",
      "noToolError": true,
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "op": "snapshot",
      "id": "after-join"
    }
  ],
  "interview": [
    "刚才这一局，你从“想玩”到“退出”一共做了什么？哪一步不确定？",
    "哪个工具让你困惑，或者你试了两次才成功？",
    "下次要“随时来一局”，你希望环境先帮你准备好什么？"
  ]
}
